      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T15:35:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree, adding another work queue does not fix the underlying problems. Cleaning up the blocking calls in the sys_work_q would resolve most sysworkq performance issues. \n\nWe also have an open discussion on lowering its priority below `sysworkq` (crrev.com/c/8523323) so console activity doesn\u0027t starve `sysworkq`.",
      "parentUuid": "ce8ce18c_efec8225",
      "range": {
